# luau-obfuscator · v0.4 (in progress)

A high-strength Luau (Roblox-flavor) obfuscator. **v0.2 adds control-flow
flattening (D4) and dead-code injection (D5)** on top of the v0.1 foundation:
identifier renaming, bitxor-ed numbers, XOR-encrypted strings, and a
dispatch-state-machine that shuffles top-level statement order behind a
`while true do` loop.

**v0.3–v0.4 adds a full bytecode VM compiler + Luau runtime template** that
faithfully mirrors the reference sample's custom interpreter, LZW compression,
position-dependent XOR cipher, and 70-op dispatch loop. The obfuscated output
runs on any Luau 0.x runtime (Roblox Studio, Roblox client, luau-cli).

